  "details": "When using the randomize function with more then two results. Unticking all the boxes and then dragging a value past the 100% limit will lock the entire unity window. It can only be resolved by killing the unity process from the task manager\n\n(also a randomize function with a better seed until we get our hands on udon would be really nice .w.)",
